@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@phone = 13800000001
@password = Test123456
@token = paste-login-token-here
@idempotencyToken = paste-idempotency-token-here
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 1
@orderId = 1
@paymentNo = PAY_PASTE_HERE
@requestId = REQ_PASTE_HERE


### 0. 登录获取 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginName": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 1. 获取一次性下单幂等 token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 2. [已废弃] 同步创建订单，仅保留本地调试；高并发抢票不要使用这个接口
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}"
}


### 3. 查询订单，必须只能查询当前登录用户自己的订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. 查询当前登录用户订单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 5. 创建支付单，金额来自订单 totalAmount，不允许前端传金额
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "channel": "MOCK"
}


### 6. 查询自己的支付单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. mock-pay 支付成功，驱动订单 PAID 和库存 locked -> sold
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentNo": "{{paymentNo}}",
  "success": true
}


### 8. 重复 mock-pay 成功，应幂等返回，不重复流转库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentNo": "{{paymentNo}}",
  "success": true
}


### 9. 旧直接支付接口已废弃，应提示先创建支付单，不能绕过 payment_order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 10. 取消订单，必须是当前登录用户自己的待支付订单，并关闭 INIT/PAYING 支付单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 11. 高并发购票主链路：异步下单，userId 来自 Bearer token，请求体不传 userId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}"
}


### 12. 查询异步下单结果，必须只能查询当前登录用户自己的 requestId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
